    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HELEN: Good God. What happened to you?\nCHESSMASTER: 'It's almost seven. Make a goddam move.'\nCHESSMASTER: 'Lousy move. Not really into this game, Helen. Let's drop it. I've got a feeling about you. Let's meet. Like a date.'\nHELEN: 'I'm a terrible date. I'd mess up your life.'",
      "HELEN: Call in. Use my phone. They'll tell you -- it's all over.\nHER HAND ON WALL: AS SHE MOVES A TENTATIVE STEP HER HAND PRESSES HEAVILY, SLIDING ALONG THE WALL. THEN HER HAND MOVES A LITTLE FASTER, AND FASTER.",
      "HELEN: Why can't I drive home? I will. You. Look at you. You need a ride home. And you don't even know it.\nSUSAN: Hey! Halloran! What's the story here?\nHELEN: If she has to ask, she's never gonna know."
    ]
